    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** West’s injectable solutions business shows accelerating momentum, fueled by surging demand for high-value-polymer components and an expanding contract services offering. The product mix continues to shift toward higher-margin HVP components, reinforced by durable end-market trends in biologics and complex injectables. Geographic and regulatory headwinds are notably absent from recent commentary, suggesting a clean operating environment for now.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Management raised full-year guidance after a strong first quarter, reinforcing confidence in the demand trajectory. The aggressive share-repurchase program launched in early 2026 signals a proactive capital-return posture. Analysts broadly lifted price targets, citing the improving margin profile and service expansion; cautious notes temper the narrative only modestly, leaving execution credibility intact.",
